WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.336
-Lindsay and I are doing
something fun after the break.

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.170
Stick around, everybody.
Maybe a rematch. Who knows?

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:07.207
-Yeah.
♪♪

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:11.844
-Am I the only -- Am I the last
person that says "Lo-en"?

00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:13.480
-I think so.
[ Laughs ]

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.847
But it doesn't matter
to me, really.

00:00:14.847 --> 00:00:16.015
-I know.
-It's okay.

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:17.183
-I'm, like,
your old pal, though.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:18.684
-Yeah. That's why it
doesn't matter.

00:00:18.684 --> 00:00:22.054
-I've known you for so long,
but it was always "Lo-han."

00:00:22.054 --> 00:00:23.088
but I think --

00:00:23.088 --> 00:00:24.457
-I said "Lo-en" once.

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:25.758
-Yeah, and I took that
and I kept it in my brain.

00:00:25.758 --> 00:00:28.060
-And everyone did.
[ Laughs ]

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:29.395
-And now every time I say like,
"Lindsay Lo-en,"

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:30.763
you're like, "Lo-han."

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:34.100
-My dad -- he was like,
"You know it's Lo-han, Lindsay."

